:Namespace CommonProviders
⍝ Pre-configured OAuth provider settings for common services

    ∇ r←GitHub flow
      ⍝ GitHub OAuth configuration
      ⍝ Arguments:
      ⍝   flow - 'authorizationCode' or 'deviceCode'
      ⍝ Returns namespace with authUrl, tokenUrl, and recommended settings
      ⍝ User must add: clientId, clientSecret
      :If ~(⊂flow)∊'authorizationCode' 'deviceCode'
          ⎕SIGNAL ⊂('EN' 11) ('Message' 'flow must be authorizationCode or deviceCode')
      :EndIf
      r←(
          authUrl: 'https://github.com/login/oauth/authorize'
          tokenUrl: 'https://github.com/login/oauth/access_token'
          deviceUrl: 'https://github.com/login/device/code'
          flow: flow
          usePKCE: 1
      )
    ∇

    ∇ r←Google flow
      ⍝ Google OAuth configuration
      ⍝ Arguments:
      ⍝   flow - 'authorizationCode' or 'deviceCode'
      ⍝ Returns namespace with URLs and recommended settings
      ⍝ User must add: clientId, clientSecret
      :If ~(⊂flow)∊'authorizationCode' 'deviceCode'
          ⎕SIGNAL ⊂('EN' 11) ('Message' 'flow must be authorizationCode or deviceCode')
      :EndIf
      r←(
          authUrl: 'https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth'
          tokenUrl: 'https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token'
          deviceUrl: 'https://oauth2.googleapis.com/device/code'
          flow: flow
          usePKCE: 1
      )
    ∇

    ∇ r←Microsoft flow
      ⍝ Microsoft OAuth configuration (Azure AD v2.0)
      ⍝ Arguments:
      ⍝   flow - 'authorizationCode' or 'deviceCode'
      ⍝ Returns namespace with URLs and recommended settings
      ⍝ User must add: clientId, clientSecret (or tenant-specific URLs)
      :If ~(⊂flow)∊'authorizationCode' 'deviceCode'
          ⎕SIGNAL ⊂('EN' 11) ('Message' 'flow must be authorizationCode or deviceCode')
      :EndIf
      r←(
          authUrl: 'https://login.microsoftonline.com/common/oauth2/v2.0/authorize'
          tokenUrl: 'https://login.microsoftonline.com/common/oauth2/v2.0/token'
          deviceUrl: 'https://login.microsoftonline.com/common/oauth2/v2.0/devicecode'
          flow: flow
          usePKCE: 1
      )
    ∇

    ∇ r←Auth0 domain
      ⍝ Auth0 OAuth configuration
      ⍝ Arguments:
      ⍝   domain - Your Auth0 domain (e.g., 'myapp.auth0.com' or 'myapp.us.auth0.com')
      ⍝ Returns namespace with URLs and recommended settings
      ⍝ User must add: clientId, clientSecret
      :If 0=≢domain
          ⎕SIGNAL ⊂('EN' 11) ('Message' 'Auth0 domain is required')
      :EndIf
      r←(
          authUrl: ('https://',domain,'/authorize')
          tokenUrl: ('https://',domain,'/oauth/token')
          flow: 'authorizationCode'
          usePKCE: 1
      )
    ∇

:EndNamespace
